SELECT 'gongkao', '排列问题', 'kp-xc-pc-perm', CAST($${"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 1}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "排列问题"}]}, {"type": "highlightBlock", "attrs": {"backgroundColor": "#fffbeb", "borderColor": "#f59e0b", "icon": "💡"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "核心结论：", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "排列是从n个不同元素中取m个排成一列，顺序有关，公式Anm = n!/(n-m)!。"}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "一、知识要点"}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "排列公式：Anm = n!/(n-n)! = n*(n-1)*...*(n-m+1)"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "全排列：Ann = n!，所有元素都参与排列"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "排列与组合的区别：排列顺序有关，组合顺序无关"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "含相同元素的排列：n!/(n1!*n2!*...*nk!)"}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "二、解题方法"}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "确定是否为排列问题（顺序是否有关）"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "确定n和m的值"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "套用排列公式计算"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "含相同元素时除以重复元素的阶乘"}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "三、易错点"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "排列和组合搞混"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "n和m的值确定错误"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "含相同元素时忘记除以重复元素的阶乘"}]}]}]}, {"type": "highlightBlock", "attrs": {"backgroundColor": "#eff6ff", "borderColor": "#3b82f6", "icon": "📊"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "刷题建议：", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "排列问题的关键是\"顺序有关\"。选出来还要排顺序就用排列。"}]}]}]}$$ AS jsonb), NULL, '数量关系-排列组合-排列问题的核心知识点和解题方法。', category_node.id, CAST('["数量关系", "排列组合", "排列问题"]' AS jsonb), FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, NOW(), 0, 0, CAST('{"content_type": "knowledge_point", "category_code": "kp_pc_perm", "source": "fba_content_engine"}' AS jsonb), 1, NOW()
